  "body": "The help.github.com domain is retired, and the \"Tracing changes in a file\" article no longer exists under that name. The old URL now 301-redirects to docs.github.com, where the content has been folded into the broader \"Viewing and understanding files\" page.\r\n\r\nLink to that page's blame section directly, so the \"GitHub's blame utility\" link text still matches what the reader lands on.\r\n",
